<style>
  footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.45);
    padding: 4.5rem 0 0;
    direction: rtl;
  }
  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .footer-brand img { width: 48px; margin-bottom: 1rem; opacity: 0.85; }
  .brand-name {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.85);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .brand-sub { font-size: 0.65rem; color: rgba(184,147,58,0.6); letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .footer-about { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.85; max-width: 260px; }
  .footer-social { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .social-link {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.4);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .social-link:hover { border-color: var(--gold-light); color: var(--gold-light); }
  .social-link svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }

  .footer-col h5 {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.75);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .footer-col ul { list-style: none; }
  .footer-col li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .footer-col a {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.4);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: rgba(248,244,238,0.8); }

  .contact-line {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(248,244,238,0.4);
  }
  .contact-line svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; stroke: rgba(184,147,58,0.6); fill: none; stroke-width: 1.3; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .footer-bottom strong { color: rgba(184,147,58,0.6); }
  .footer-bottom-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .footer-bottom-links a { color: rgba(248,244,238,0.25); transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer-bottom-links a:hover { color: rgba(248,244,238,0.6); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="תכלת וארגמן" />
        <div class="brand-name">תכלת וארגמן</div>
        <div class="brand-sub">כיפות ואביזרים בעבודת יד</div>
        <p class="footer-about">בוטיק מקוון לכיפות ואביזרים יהודיים. כל פריט נוצר מאהבה ומסירות, בעבודת יד מלאה, עם תשומת לב לכל פרט.</p>
        <div class="footer-social">
          <a href="#" class="social-link" aria-label="Instagram">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="social-link" aria-label="Facebook">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/972500000000" class="social-link" aria-label="WhatsApp">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 013.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 018 8v.5z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h5>ניווט</h5>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">בית</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#products">הקולקציה</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">קטגוריות</a></li>
          <li><a href="/simulator">מדמה כיפה</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#about">אודות</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#contact">צרי קשר</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h5>קטגוריות</h5>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיפות עם פס</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיפות חלקות</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיפות מקושקשות</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיפות פריק</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיסויי פלטה וחלה</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories">כיסויי טלית ותפילין</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h5>יצירת קשר</h5>
        <div class="contact-line">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.82 19.79 19.79 0 01.01 1.22 2 2 0 012 .01h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6z"/></svg>
          <span>WhatsApp – להזמנה מהירה</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-line">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
          <span>techelesargaman@gmail.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-line">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12,6 12,12 16,14"/></svg>
          <span>מענה תוך 24 שעות</span>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-line">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16,8 20,8 23,11 23,16 16,16 16,8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
          <span>משלוחים לכל רחבי הארץ</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} <strong>תכלת וארגמן</strong> — כל הזכויות שמורות</span>
      <div class="footer-bottom-links">
        <a href="#">תנאי שימוש</a>
        <a href="#">מדיניות פרטיות</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<button id="back-top" aria-label="חזרה לראש" style="position:fixed;bottom:2rem;left:2rem;width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--parchment);border:none;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 0.3s,transform 0.3s;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:80;">
  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="18,15 12,9 6,15"/></svg>
</button>
<style>#back-top.show { opacity: 1 !important; pointer-events: all !important; }</style>
